-- Expression defaults declared in an IMPORTED module are taken at a named site and
-- at a construction here (TYPICALLY-ONE-BEHAVIOUR-SPEC.md W7 across an IMPORT).
-- The declaring half is ok/typically-expression-import-def.l4. What each default
-- names, `the usual rate` and `the usual colour`, is not defined in this file.

IMPORT `typically-expression-import-def`

#ASSERT (`imported scaled` WITH base IS 10) EQUALS 40
#ASSERT (`imported scaled` WITH base IS 10, rate IS 2) EQUALS 20
#ASSERT (`imported scaled` WITH base IS 10, colour IS Red) EQUALS 0

GIVETH A Paint
`some paint` MEANS Paint WITH layers IS 2

#ASSERT (`some paint`'s coats) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT (`some paint`'s colour) EQUALS Green
#ASSERT (`some paint`'s layers) EQUALS 2
#EVAL `some paint`
